5. Gacha core: item table, weighted pull, inventory, collection grid
6. Pull screen animation
7. Quiz UI wired to rewards and sessions, with anti-abuse limits (minimum session length, one quiz per session, daily shard cap)
8. Auth, deploy, real art, polish

